<cell>Match each function with its graph.
<ol>
<li>
<m>f(x,y) = \displaystyle \frac{1}{x^2 + y^2}</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>f(x,y) = x^3 - \sin(y)</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>f(x,y) = x + 2y + 3</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>f(x,y) = - 4 e^{-x^2 - y^2}</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>f(x,y) = - y^2</m>
</li>
</ol>
